-- statement:
--   This bundle defines the fixed ordered array `sourceLeafBlock1` of $1000$ pairs $(g,s)$ of a natural number and a finite Unicode string, by concatenating its private literal subarrays numbered $4$ through $7$ in that order. Each of its $4$ literal subarrays contains $250$ entries. Concatenation preserves every listed entry and its order and performs no sorting or deduplication. The declaration has no parameters or hypotheses and defines data rather than a proposition. It asserts no decoding success, graph correspondence, geometric realization, feasibility, infeasibility or certificate correctness; it supplies no proof or lookup default.
--
--   **Source and scope.** Primary §9 pp.21–24; final formal_lp/hypermap/verify_all.hl and main/prove_flyspeck_lp.hl:856–1037. This is one consecutive block of the 43,078 source-fixed LP selector records, reconstructed in original order by sourceLeafCodes. Splitting the literal table permits draft upload; it changes no leaf, row or certificate obligation.
